    "id": "about-1",
    "section": "about",
    "title": "About Fizza Aman",
    "content": "I am Fizza Aman, a BS Computer Science & Information Technology student at NED University of Engineering and Technology in Karachi, Pakistan. I expect to graduate in September 2027 and my CGPA is 3.28 / 4.00. I work at the meeting point of AI and 3D: deep learning for medical imaging, computer vision, multi-agent LLM systems and AR/VR. I like building things people can actually see and use. Outside code I love cooking, travelling, playing badminton and, honestly, sleeping. This portfolio is themed like a pink travel kitchen because cooking and travel are how I relax and recharge. I am based in Karachi, Pakistan. I speak English (fluent, professional) and basic French (coursework at NED). I am looking for internships and junior roles in AI/ML engineering, computer vision, and 3D/AR web development.",
